error_signature: No tests were found!!!|SIGSYS\*\*\*Exception|no member named 'setMailAuthentication' in 'ImapConfigurationEditor'|no member named 'Encrypt_SSL' in 'QMailTransport'|Failed to bind socket.*Read-only file system
severity: 3
category: testing, build-system, cmake, ohos, portability, syscall, socket, network
match_keywords: zero add_test, qsystemsemaphore sigsys, qt_no_ssl, abstract socket dbus
title: 上游零add_test时配方侧注入CTest注册与无SysV无SSL鸿蒙下Qt库的IPC替换及去守卫适配
root_cause: 上游tests仅add_executable零add_test致No tests were found；鸿蒙内核无SysV IPC致QSystemSemaphore触发不可捕获SIGSYS；OHOS qtbase为QT_NO_SSL变体致纯键值配置与Encrypt_SSL枚举被守卫缺成员；只读tmp加长路径超sun_path致dbus会话bind失败
verification_cmd: 真机conan create后检查build/ctest_upstream.log含29项真实执行与HMBS_UPSTREAM_TEST_RESULT discovered=29 executed=29及dbus abstract套接字拉起与messageserver注册日志；test_package编译链接通过
affected_scope: 上游零CTest注册且依赖SysV信号量锁与QT_NO_SSL守卫及D-Bus会话总线的Qt系C加加库在无SysV无SSL只读tmp的鸿蒙真机环境
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: inject-ctest-qmutex-unguarding-abstract-dbus
rec_description: 配方侧解析tests动态注入29项add_test并WORKING_DIRECTORY指向各用例源码目录；OHOS下以进程内QMutex注册表替换locks.cpp的QSystemSemaphore；剥离纯配置QT_NO_SSL守卫并常驻Encrypt_SSL枚举；dbus最小配置改用unix abstract套接字绕过只读tmp与108字符上限
rec_command: conanfile.py新增_patch_register_qmf_tests/_patch_locks_qmutex_on_ohos/_patch_qt_no_ssl_config/_patch_transport_encrypt_enum/_ensure_dbus_session抽象套接字；build()顺序调用；MANIFEST.yml披露harness接入与ohos_feature缺口
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: conan-recipe-plus-test-package
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: disable-glibc-benchmark-and-split-network-gaps
fallback_description: OHOS下硬删除glibc-only的benchmarks/tst_messageserver；smtp直连free.fr失败按environment与ohos_feature拆分gaps并保留真实test_failure阻断
